<view class="page">
  <view class="page-title">风险预警</view>
  <view class="page-subtitle">预警由症状自评达到阈值触发，请及时查看并登记随访。</view>

  <view class="chip-row">
    <view class="chip chip--active">全部</view>
    <view class="chip">提示</view>
    <view class="chip">警告</view>
    <view class="chip">严重</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card alert alert--critical">
    <view class="alert__head">
      <text class="badge badge--danger">严重</text>
      <text class="alert__time">— 月 — 日　—:—</text>
    </view>
    <view class="card-title">预警规则（占位）</view>
    <view class="muted">当前状态：待处理</view>
    <view class="muted">通知渠道：—</view>
    <view class="btn btn--secondary btn--block alert__action" hover-class="btn--pressed" aria-role="button">
      查看预警详情
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card alert alert--warning">
    <view class="alert__head">
      <text class="badge badge--warning">警告</text>
      <text class="alert__time">— 月 — 日　—:—</text>
    </view>
    <view class="card-title">预警规则（占位）</view>
    <view class="muted">当前状态：已确认</view>
    <view class="muted">通知渠道：—</view>
    <view class="btn btn--secondary btn--block alert__action" hover-class="btn--pressed" aria-role="button">
      查看预警详情
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card alert alert--info">
    <view class="alert__head">
      <text class="badge badge--info">提示</text>
      <text class="alert__time">— 月 — 日　—:—</text>
    </view>
    <view class="card-title">预警规则（占位）</view>
    <view class="muted">当前状态：已随访</view>
    <view class="muted">通知渠道：—</view>
    <view class="btn btn--secondary btn--block alert__action" hover-class="btn--pressed" aria-role="button">
      查看预警详情
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice">
    通知渠道包括小程序弹窗、语音提示、微信服务通知与审计日志；未送达时的兜底通道尚未确定。
  </view>
  <view class="notice notice--warning">
    预警处理与随访登记由照护管理员或康复治疗师在 Web 后台完成，小程序内仅查看。
  </view>
  <view class="hint">本页为结构占位，预警数据与处理动作待接入。</view>
</view>
